The dragon-engine adaptation borrows 5 methodologies from MemOS:

  ① Self-evolving memory OS architecture (4-layer pipeline: ingest / consolidate / retrieve / inject)
  ② Ultra-persistent memory (local SQLite + heat score, avoids repetitive LLM tool calls)
  ③ Hybrid retrieval (vector + BM25 + graph hops with Reciprocal Rank Fusion)
  ④ Cross-task reasoning routing (session_id-keyed memory sub-graphs)
